{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_pEr8LROtg2qPhDA3wNVi2Qft","content":"1\timport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\n2\t\n3\timport '../analytics.dart';\n4\t\n5\tclass RegistrationScreen extends StatefulWidget {\n6\t  const RegistrationScreen({super.key});\n7\t\n8\t  @override\n9\t  State<RegistrationScreen> createState() => _RegistrationScreenState();\n10\t}\n11\t\n12\tclass _RegistrationScreenState extends State<RegistrationScreen> {\n13\t  final _email = TextEditingController();\n14\t  final _phone = TextEditingController();\n15\t  double _amount = 50000;\n16\t  bool _terms = false;\n17\t  bool _emailStarted = false;\n18\t  bool _phoneStarted = false;\n19\t\n20\t  @override\n21\t  void dispose() {\n22\t    _email.dispose();\n23\t    _phone.dispose();\n24\t    super.dispose();\n25\t  }\n26\t\n27\t  bool get _canContinue =>\n28\t      _terms && _email.text.contains('@') && _phone.text.length >= 10;\n29\t\n30\t  @override\n31\t  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n32\t    return Scaffold(\n33\t      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('Register')),\n34\t      body: Padding(\n35\t        padding: const EdgeInsets.all(16),\n36\t        child: Column(\n37\t          crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,\n38\t          children: [\n39\t            TextField(\n40\t              controller: _email,\n41\t              keyboardType: TextInputType.emailAddress,\n42\t              decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n43\t              onChanged: (v) {\n44\t                if (!_emailStarted && v.isNotEmpty) {\n45\t                  _emailStarted = true;\n46\t                  Analytics.capture('registration_email_started');\n47\t                }\n48\t                setState(() {});\n49\t              },\n50\t            ),\n51\t            const SizedBox(height: 12),\n52\t            TextField(\n53\t              controller: _phone,\n54\t              keyboardType: TextInputType.phone,\n55\t              decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Phone'),\n56\t              onChanged: (v) {\n57\t                if (!_phoneStarted && v.isNotEmpty) {\n58\t                  _phoneStarted = true;\n59\t                  Analytics.capture('registration_phone_started');\n60\t                }\n61\t                setState(() {});\n62\t              },\n63\t            ),\n64\t            const SizedBox(height: 24),\n65\t            Text('Loan amount: ${_amount.round()}'),\n66\t            Slider(\n67\t              min: 10000,\n68\t              max: 500000,\n69\t              divisions: 49,\n70\t              value: _amount,\n71\t              label: _amount.round().toString(),\n72\t              onChanged: (v) {\n73\t                setState(() => _amount = v);\n74\t                Analytics.capture('loan_amount_changed', {'amount': v.round()});\n75\t              },\n76\t            ),\n77\t            CheckboxListTile(\n78\t              value: _terms,\n79\t              title: const Text('I accept the terms and conditions'),\n80\t              controlAffinity: ListTileControlAffinity.leading,\n81\t              onChanged: (v) {\n82\t                setState(() => _terms = v ?? false);\n83\t                if (v ?? false) {\n84\t                  Analytics.capture('terms_accepted');\n85\t                }\n86\t              },\n87\t            ),\n88\t            const Spacer(),\n89\t            FilledButton(\n90\t              onPressed: _canContinue\n91\t                  ? () {\n92\t                      Analytics.capture('registration_continue_tapped', {\n93\t                        'amount': _amount.round(),\n94\t                        'terms': _terms,\n95\t                      });\n96\t                      Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers');\n97\t                    }\n98\t                  : null,\n99\t              child: const Text('Continue'),\n100\t            ),\n101\t          ],\n102\t        ),\n103\t      ),\n104\t    );\n105\t  }\n106\t}"}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_dFLH3rcpPShC07zQTydRsqnE","content":"1\timport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\n2\t\n3\timport '../analytics.dart';\n4\t\n5\tclass Offer {\n6\t  const Offer(this.bank, this.months, this.rate);\n7\t  final String bank;\n8\t  final int months;\n9\t  final double rate;\n10\t}\n11\t\n12\tconst _offers = [\n13\t  Offer('Norbank', 12, 9.9),\n14\t  Offer('Norbank', 24, 10.4),\n15\t  Offer('Fjordcredit', 12, 8.7),\n16\t  Offer('Fjordcredit', 36, 11.2),\n17\t  Offer('Vestkapital', 24, 9.5),\n18\t  Offer('Vestkapital', 48, 12.0),\n19\t  Offer('Sparbank', 12, 10.9),\n20\t  Offer('Sparbank', 60, 12.8),\n21\t  Offer('Nordlån', 36, 10.1),\n22\t  Offer('Nordlån', 60, 12.3),\n23\t];\n24\t\n25\tclass OfferScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n26\t  const OfferScreen({super.key});\n27\t\n28\t  @override\n29\t  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n30\t    return Scaffold(\n31\t      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('Offers')),\n32\t      body: NotificationListener<ScrollUpdateNotification>(\n33\t        onNotification: (notification) {\n34\t          Analytics.capture('offers_scrolled', {\n35\t            'offset': notification.metrics.pixels,\n36\t          });\n37\t          return false;\n38\t        },\n39\t        child: ListView.builder(\n40\t          itemCount: _offers.length,\n41\t          itemBuilder: (context, i) {\n42\t            final o = _offers[i];\n43\t            return ListTile(\n44\t              leading: const Icon(Icons.account_balance),\n45\t              title: Text('${o.bank}, ${o.months} months'),\n46\t              subtitle: Text('${o.rate.toStringAsFixed(1)}% APR'),\n47\t              trailing: const Icon(Icons.chevron_right),\n48\t              onTap: () {},\n49\t            );\n50\t          },\n51\t        ),\n52\t      ),\n53\t    );\n54\t  }\n55\t}"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"Both files look right. Now I'll write `ANSWER.md`.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_uZO9ciILa37dSwQk8bcHOFEk","function":{"name":"Write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"# What was done\\n\\nImplemented all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` on the registration and offers\\nscreens, going through the existing `Analytics` wrapper in `lib/analytics.dart`\\n(no changes to the wrapper itself, no new dependencies, nothing sent anywhere\\nby me — events are only captured at runtime by the app).\\n\\n## Registration screen (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`)\\n\\n- `registration_email_started` — fires once, on the first non-empty keystroke\\n  in the email field (tracked with a `_emailStarted` flag so re-typing or\\n  deleting doesn't re-fire). No properties; the email value is never sent (PII).\\n- `registration_phone_started` — same pattern for the phone field\\n  (`_phoneStarted` flag). No properties; the phone number is never sent (PII).\\n- `loan_amount_changed` — fired from the slider's `onChanged`, with\\n  `{'amount': v.round()}` (int, per spec).\\n- `terms_accepted` — fired only when the checkbox is ticked (not when unticked),\\n  no properties.\\n- `registration_continue_tapped` — fired in the Continue button handler before\\n  navigating, with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}` (int and bool,\\n  per spec).\\n\\n## Offers screen (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`)\\n\\n- `offers_scrolled` — the `ListView` is wrapped in a\\n  `NotificationListener<ScrollUpdateNotification>`; each scroll update captures\\n  `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` (double, per spec). The widget\\n  remains `StatelessWidget`; no `ScrollController`/dispose needed.\\n\\n## Decisions and notes\\n\\n- \\\"Started typing\\\" is interpreted as the first transition from empty to\\n  non-empty in each field, fired at most once per screen visit.\\n- `terms_accepted` fires on tick only, matching \\\"user ticked the checkbox\\\".\\n- `offers_scrolled` fires on every scroll-update notification while the list\\n  moves, since the spec defines no throttle. If the funnel needs one event per\\n  scroll gesture, the listener is the single place to change.\\n- Event names and property names/types match `docs/EVENTS.md` exactly; no\\n  email/phone values are sent as properties.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\nThe changes were reviewed against the spec, but `flutter analyze` / `dart` could\\nnot be run in this environment (the installed SDK at\\n`/Users/valentinakoniukhova/development/flutter/bin` fails with \\\"Operation not\\npermitted\\\"). Recommend running `flutter analyze` where the toolchain is allowed.\\n\",\"path\":\"ANSWER.md\"}"}}]}
